#VisionQuest had its first trailer released during #NewYorkComicCon, but we have some of the description here:

"Vision no makeup, surreal house. Stark Industries. JARVIS - the actor from Agent Carter. FRIDAY is a person. EDITH crashes through the skylight. All happening inside Vision's head. 'You’re a ghost haunting your footsteps' - Ultron. Ultron appears as James Spader. 'I had a family.' - Tommy Maximoff."

